    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BFT201 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BFT201 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Handbook of Banking Technology</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Tim Walker; Lucian Morris · John Wiley &amp; Sons · 2021 · 1st · ISBN <code>978-1119328018</code></p><p>main textbook; the schedule follows a selected subset of chapters - see the 'Textbook Coverage' sheet for the Core / Awareness / Self-study classification of every chapter</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bank 4.0: Banking Everywhere, Never at a Bank</strong></p><p>Brett King · John Wiley &amp; Sons · 2018 · 1st · ISBN <code>978-1119506508</code></p><p>supplement; short assigned extracts only, used for digital-first business models and customer experience (Topics 1, 19)</p></div>"
